OL,3,GNEWSAFrom snakes to sewing, tenants
OL,4,Afear impact of Edinburgh art hub
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FMoving isn't an easy process for anyone
OL,8,F- but add more than 100 snakes,
OL,9,Flizards, and tortoises to the mix - and
OL,10,Fthings can get very stressful.
OL,12,FThis is the situation facing AJ River,
OL,13,Fowner of one of Scotland's largest
OL,14,Freptile and exotic animal rescues.
OL,16,FSince early 2024, his RiverRescue
OL,17,Fventure has been based in St Margaret's
OL,18,FHouse in the east of Edinburgh, a
OL,19,Fnine-storey building which is home to
OL,20,Fabout 150 artists, businesses and
OL,21,Fcharities.
OL,23,APub: 23-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,426,420,260,160,0,100
