OL,3,GNEWSAFrom snakes to sewing, tenants
OL,4,Afear impact of Edinburgh art hub
OL,5,Aclosure
OL,6,
OL,7,FBut tenants were told at the end of
OL,8,FSeptember they have less than four
OL,9,Fmonths to leave, as the building is
OL,10,Fbeing sold.
